# Keep every text file byte-identical across platforms. The pipeline patcher
# edits by byte offset and the diff view compares whole lines, so a Windows
# checkout that turned LF into CRLF made an unchanged file look rewritten.
* text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.zip binary
*.node binary
